      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Calculus Concept Map\n\nRead **top to bottom**: Functions & Graphs (how to read a curve) → Derivatives & Rates of Change (how fast something changes) → Area & Accumulation (undoing a rate to find total change) → Interpretation (turning a result into a real sentence).\n\nArrows show how ideas connect; the label explains the relationship. Click any card to open the full note — each one has a math example and a real-world example.",
